<title>CHINA: Shanghai Yaohua 1996 net down 56.85 pct.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Yaohua 1996 net down 56.85 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover	   589.535	  vs	  646.435</p>
<p> Net profit	 113.563	  vs	  263.193</p>
<p> Net asset per share     2.98 yuan   vs    3.62 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share	0.23 yuan   vs    0.67 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Yaohua Pilkington Glass Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Note: the results were published in a company statement on Monday. The numbers are based on domestic accounting standards. Figures based on international accounting standards were not available.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors proposed a cash dividend of 0.15 yuan per share based on 1996 net, pending approval of a shareholders meeting, the company statement said.</p>
</text>
